        <div class="article__body prose">
          <blockquote>
<ul>
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Rockstar previewed <strong>6 radio stations</strong> on 8 Oct 2026: Cocoteo FM, Back Country Radio, AfroBank FM, The Chamber, Flash FM and Dirty South Classics.</li>
<li><strong>Also confirmed:</strong> on-demand <strong>podcasts</strong>, and listening <strong>on foot</strong> with in-game headphones or earbuds linked to your phone.</li>
<li><strong>Album:</strong> “Grand Theft Auto VI: The Album”, <strong>34 tracks, due 19 Nov</strong>. Full in-game station lists are <strong>not announced</strong>.</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Words used on this page.</strong> <em>Station</em> is a radio channel in the game. <em>DJ</em> is the host. <em>Podcast</em> is a talk show you pick to play.</p>
