<h2 id="podcasts-and-listening-on-foot" tabindex="-1">Podcasts and listening on foot</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Podcasts:</strong> on-demand shows are part of the audio setup.</li>
<li><strong>On foot:</strong> you can listen with in-game headphones or earbuds that connect to your phone.</li>
<li><strong>Exactly how to switch stations or start a podcast</strong> (buttons and menus): not announced. We will add the exact PS5 and Xbox buttons after launch.</li>
</ul>
