<h2 id="faq" tabindex="-1">FAQ</h2>
<h3 id="how-many-radio-stations-are-in-gta-6" tabindex="-1">How many radio stations are in GTA 6?</h3>
<p>Six were previewed on 8 October 2026. The full list is not announced.</p>
<h3 id="does-gta-6-have-podcasts" tabindex="-1">Does GTA 6 have podcasts?</h3>
<p>Yes. On-demand podcasts are confirmed.</p>
<h3 id="can-i-listen-to-music-on-foot" tabindex="-1">Can I listen to music on foot?</h3>
<p>Yes, with in-game headphones or earbuds linked to your phone.</p>
<h3 id="when-does-the-gta-6-album-come-out" tabindex="-1">When does the GTA 6 album come out?</h3>
<p>19 November 2026, with 34 tracks.</p>
